## Interface: 16001
## Title: ZoneXP Advisor
## Title-koKR: ZoneXP Advisor (레벨업 지역 추천)
## Notes: Recommends the best leveling zones from your current XP and quest progress. Reads quest data from QuestieDB when installed.
## Notes-koKR: 현재 경험치와 퀘스트 진행도를 바탕으로 레벨업에 가장 좋은 지역을 추천합니다. QuestieDB가 설치되어 있으면 그 데이터를 읽어서 사용합니다.
## Version: 1.1.0
## Author: DulgiKim
## Category: Quests
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZoneXPAdvisor\icon.png
## AddonCompartmentFunc: ZoneXPAdvisor_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: ZoneXPAdvisor_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: ZoneXPAdvisor_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
## OptionalDeps: QuestieDB, Questie
## SavedVariables: ZoneXPAdvisorDB

